      "worked": "Let $x$ be the time in seconds. Take the reciprocal of both sides, then multiply both sides by $100$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{70}{8.4}&=\\frac{100}{x}\\\\\\frac{8.4}{70}&=\\frac{x}{100}\\\\\\frac{8.4\\times100}{70}&=x\\\\x&=12\\end{align*}$$\nGemma takes $12\\text{ s}$.",
